cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research synthesis, please cite the versioned repository
  artifact. Cite the five underlying research repositories separately when
  relying on their specific claims or specifications.
type: software
title: "Beyond Static Computation: Object-Centric Structural Evolution and Persistent Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  A specification-first research synthesis connecting Adversarial Structural
  Security Intelligence (ASSI), Dynamic Bucket Tree of Permutation (D-BTP),
  Constrained Delta Evolution (CDE), World Entity and Structural Intelligence
  Operations (WE-SIO), and Object-Centric Structural Reasoning and Evolution
  (OCSRE). It proposes object-native structural interfaces, persistent
  residuals, constrained delta evolution, resource-aware structural discovery,
  evidence-bound capability relay, and falsifiable experimental protocols
  spanning SQL data, dynamic scheduling, and financial time series. These
  proposals are research hypotheses and validation plans, not established
  empirical results.
